      <title>198美元Vercel账单逼开发者转向24美元VPS自托管</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260904/198%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83Vercel%E8%B4%A6%E5%8D%95%E9%80%BC%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85%E8%BD%AC%E5%90%9124%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83VPS%E8%87%AA%E6%89%98%E7%AE%A1/</link>
